{"unit_id":"tag:06G9:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n环（ring）是交换（commutative）的，且具有 <MATH_0001>。局部环（local ring）<MATH_0002> 的极大理想（maximal ideal）记为 <MATH_0003>。正整数的集合（set）记为 <MATH_0004>。如果 <MATH_0005> 是范畴（category）<MATH_0006> 的对象（object），我们用 <MATH_0007> 表示函子（functor）<MATH_0008>，见注记 <REF_0001>（<REF_0002>）。警告：这可能与其他章节中的记号冲突，在其他章节中我们有时用 <MATH_0009> 表示 <MATH_0010>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n本章始终设 <MATH_0011> 是诺特环（Noetherian ring），<MATH_0012> 是从 <MATH_0013> 到域（field）的有限环映射（finite ring map）。这个映射（map）的核（kernel）记为 <MATH_0014>，像（image）记为 <MATH_0015>。结果表明，<MATH_0016> 是极大理想（maximal ideal），<MATH_0017> 是域（field），扩张（extension）<MATH_0018> 是有限（finite）的。见 (<REF_0003>) 附近的讨论。\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"该环译法待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"该环交换性译法待决。"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环","context":"该局部环译法待决。"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想","context":"该极大理想译法待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"该集合译法待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"该范畴译法待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"该对象译法待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"该函子译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环","context":"该诺特环译法待决。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"该域译法待决。"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射","context":"该有限环映射译法待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"该映射译法待决。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"该核译法待决。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"该像译法待决。"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"该域扩张译法待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"该有限性译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
