{"unit_id":"tag:06GB:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n动机。形式形变理论（formal deformation theory）的一个重要应用是由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示的可表性判据。设给定局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的基 <MATH_0001> 及函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。设 <MATH_0003> 是 <MATH_0004> 上的有限型（finite type）域（field），即给定有限型（finite type）态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>。Artin 的判据之一是，对任意元素（element）<MATH_0006>，与三元组 <MATH_0007> 关联的预形变函子（predeformation functor）应当是预可表（prorepresentable）的。由态射（Morphisms），引理 <REF_0001>，<MATH_0008> 在 <MATH_0009> 上为有限型（finite type）的条件意味着存在一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0010>，使得 <MATH_0011> 是有限（finite）的 <MATH_0012>-代数（algebra）。这说明了我们为什么在本章始终使用如下的基范畴（base category）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Artin"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"formal deformation theory","target_term":"形式形变理论"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"predeformation functor","target_term":"预形变函子"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"预可表"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"base category","target_term":"基范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"formal deformation theory","target_term":"形式形变理论","context":"该形式形变理论名称译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"该代数空间译法待决。"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"该局部诺特性质译法待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"该函子译法待决。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"该有限型性质译法待决。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"该域译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"该态射译法待决。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"该元素译法待决。"},{"source_term":"predeformation functor","target_term":"预形变函子","context":"该预形变函子译法待决。"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"预可表","context":"该预可表性质译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"该章节名称译法待决。"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"该仿射开集译法待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"该有限性译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"该代数译法待决。"},{"source_term":"base category","target_term":"基范畴","context":"该基范畴译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06GC:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是诺特环（Noetherian ring），并设 <MATH_0002> 是有限环映射（finite ring map），其中 <MATH_0003> 是域（field）。我们定义 <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> 为具有以下内容的范畴（category）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对象（objects）是对 <MATH_0005>，其中 <MATH_0006> 是 Artinian 局部（Artinian local）<MATH_0007>-代数（algebra），而 <MATH_0008> 是 <MATH_0009>-代数同构（algebra isomorphism），并且\n<STRUCT_0003> 态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010> 是局部（local）的 <MATH_0011>-代数同态（algebra homomorphisms），使得 <MATH_0012>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n我们称处于<TEXTITOPEN_0002>经典情形（classical case）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果 <MATH_0013> 是诺特完备局部环（Noetherian complete local ring），而 <MATH_0014> 是它的剩余域（residue field）。\n","allowed_english":["Artinian"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Artinian local","target_term":"Artinian 局部"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"algebra isomorphism","target_term":"代数同构"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"algebra homomorphisms","target_term":"代数同态"},{"source_term":"classical case","target_term":"经典情形"},{"source_term":"Noetherian complete local ring","target_term":"诺特完备局部环"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环","context":"该诺特环译法待决。"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射","context":"该有限环映射译法待决。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"该域译法待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"该范畴译法待决。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"该对象译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Artinian local","target_term":"Artinian 局部","context":"该 Artinian 局部性质译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"该代数译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra isomorphism","target_term":"代数同构","context":"该代数同构译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"该态射译法待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"该环同态局部性译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra homomorphisms","target_term":"代数同态","context":"该代数同态译法待决。"},{"source_term":"classical case","target_term":"经典情形","context":"该经典情形名称译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian complete local ring","target_term":"诺特完备局部环","context":"该完整局部环名称译法待决。"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域","context":"该剩余域译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06GB:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，如果 <MATH_0001> 是满射（surjective）的，而 <MATH_0002> 是 Artinian 局部（Artinian local）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra），则等同（identification）<MATH_0004> 若存在，就是唯一的。此外，在这种情形下，任意 <MATH_0005>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0006> 都与这些等同（identifications）相容。因此，在这种情形下，<MATH_0007> 就是局部 Artinian（local Artinian）<MATH_0008>-代数（algebras）的范畴（category），其剩余域（residue field）“是”<MATH_0009>。通过滥用记号，在一般情形下，我们也将 <MATH_0010> 的对象（objects）简单记为 <MATH_0011>。此外，我们经常写 <MATH_0012>，即假装 <MATH_0013> 中的所有环（rings）都有剩余域（residue field）<MATH_0014>（由于 <MATH_0015> 中的所有环映射（ring maps）都与给定的等同（identifications）相容，这应当不会导致任何问题）。在本章其余部分中，基环（base ring）<MATH_0016> 和域（field）<MATH_0017> 固定。范畴（category）<MATH_0018> 将作为下面所考虑的余纤维范畴（cofibered categories）的基范畴（base category）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Artinian"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Artinian local","target_term":"Artinian 局部"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"identification","target_term":"等同"},{"source_term":"algebra map","target_term":"代数映射"},{"source_term":"identifications","target_term":"等同"},{"source_term":"local Artinian","target_term":"局部 Artinian"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"ring maps","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"identifications","target_term":"等同"},{"source_term":"base ring","target_term":"基环"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"cofibered categories","target_term":"余纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"base category","target_term":"基范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"该满射性质译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Artinian local","target_term":"Artinian 局部","context":"该 Artinian 局部性质