{"unit_id":"tag:06GD:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 中的环映射（ring map）。我们称 <MATH_0003> 为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>小扩张（small extension）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果它是满射（surjective）的，且 <MATH_0004> 是非零主理想（principal ideal），被 <MATH_0005> 零化。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"small extension","target_term":"小扩张"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"principal ideal","target_term":"主理想"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"该环映射译法待决。"},{"source_term":"small extension","target_term":"小扩张","context":"该小扩张译法待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"该满射性质译法待决。"},{"source_term":"principal ideal","target_term":"主理想","context":"该主理想译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
